| Treat card-toolbar **Google Drive** label as file location / Drive write | It is the **export-dropdown trigger** (choices: optional Drive — fleet never uses — ∨ **Download**); artifact bytes live in Outputs / in-chat card body — skill § File-card chrome |
| Treat Stargate `status=running` as “on claude.ai” | Delivery = `chat_url` ∨ followup `send_verified` — skill § Dispatch delivery |
| Read `free_slots` as ask-mint room | `purpose=ask`: `other_count` vs `advisor_reserve` — skill § Parallel Chrome |
